{"id":"4070","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4070_main_white-dew_hydrometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这张照片以特写镜头显示了一些 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">已经冻结的露珠</span>。这种类型的沉积物称为 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">白露</span>。不应该与 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">白霜</span>相混淆。然而，请注意，在草叶和冷冻露珠表面上形成了微小的 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">白霜</span>晶体。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Onyema Ogueri","location":"大不列颠及北爱尔兰联合王国乌克斯桥新德纳姆","latitude":"纬度: 51° 33' 11'' N","longitude":"经度: 0° 29' 35'' W","date":"06 December 2014 1200 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.11.4.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.11.4.3"}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4046_main_white-dew-and-hoar-frost_hydrometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>这张照片显示的是草叶上的白露和白霜。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">白霜</span> 是冰的沉积物，其外观通常是结晶状，而<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">白露</span> 则是水滴（露水）的沉积物，其随后发生冻结。</p>\n<p>在这种情况下，英格兰南部覆盖的是高压区域（1027 hPa）。在晴朗的天空下，沃金厄姆的气温从前一天的最高5°C降至夜间-7°C。前一天下午1540点左右草地的温度降至0°C以下，并达到夜间最低–10 °C。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© George Anderson","location":"大不列颠及北爱尔兰联合王国英格兰沃金厄姆","latitude":"纬度: 51° 25' 5'' N","longitude":"经度: 0° 51' 48'' W","date":"23 January 2015 0951 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.11.4.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.11.4.3"}]}]}